{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CAPPA, a hero from capybara legend, needs your help! Your mission: free every capybara in the world from the evil clutches of CapyLand. But wait... who is that mysterious Stream-Bara lurking in the corner of the screen?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/evolution_gif.gif?t=1747212894\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To help you complete CAPPA\u2019s mission, you\u2019ll use an artifact known only from ancient tales \u2013 <strong>the Ropegun</strong>. Use your fluffy body and springy rope to bounce through various traps and dangers trying to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/Streamer_reaction.gif?t=1747212894\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stream-Bara has gathered the Capy-Chat \u2013 the audience of his stream, reacting live to your playthrough. You can impress them by looking cool and beating the game with ease\u2026 or rage and be memed in chat! It\u2019s all in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/voting.gif?t=1747212894\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Capy-Chat has a tool to meddle with your game \u2013 Chaos Mode. Viewers can manipulate the game logic by voting in chat, either giving you a much-needed boost or making things even harder. Will they help you beat the game? Or will they be cruel and try to sabotage your every attempt?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/customization_working.gif?t=1747212894\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully Customize your StreamBara! Choose between various accessories, keyboards, mouses, backgrounds! Heck, you can even wear wacky costumes to make your chat laugh!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/leaderboard_gif.gif?t=1747212894\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your creativity to beat the game the fastest you can and compete with your friends in the Leaderboards. Watch players from all around the world  as they struggle to be <strong>the number 1 Giga Capy Chad in the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect your <strong>real audience</strong> from <strong>Twitch</strong>  and let them vote!\u00a0<strong>Now you really ARE a streamer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2651090?t=1747212894","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2651090?t=1747212894","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/e05175ab0f0f16cb5279c4544b3f8f1a54f35d0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747212894","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/e05175ab0f0f16cb5279c4544b3f8f1a54f35d0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747212894","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3337510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CAPPA, a hero from capybara legend, needs your help! Your mission: free every capybara in the world from the evil clutches of CapyLand. But wait... who is that mysterious Stream-Bara lurking in the corner of the screen?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/evolution_gif.gif?t=1747212894\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To help you complete CAPPA\u2019s mission, you\u2019ll use an artifact known only from ancient tales \u2013 <strong>the Ropegun</strong>. Use your fluffy body and springy rope to bounce through various traps and dangers trying to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/Streamer_reaction.gif?t=1747212894\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stream-Bara has gathered the Capy-Chat \u2013 the audience of his stream, reacting live to your playthrough. You can impress them by looking cool and beating the game with ease\u2026 or rage and be memed in chat! It\u2019s all in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/voting.gif?t=1747212894\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Capy-Chat has a tool to meddle with your game \u2013 Chaos Mode. Viewers can manipulate the game logic by voting in chat, either giving you a much-needed boost or making things even harder. Will they help you beat the game? Or will they be cruel and try to sabotage your every attempt?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/customization_working.gif?t=1747212894\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully Customize your StreamBara! Choose between various accessories, keyboards, mouses, backgrounds! Heck, you can even wear wacky costumes to make your chat laugh!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/leaderboard_gif.gif?t=1747212894\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your creativity to beat the game the fastest you can and compete with your friends in the Leaderboards. Watch players from all around the world  as they struggle to be <strong>the number 1 Giga Capy Chad in the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect your <strong>real audience</strong> from <strong>Twitch</strong>  and let them vote!\u00a0<strong>Now you really ARE a streamer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Ninja Flamingos"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/60b665c151e1b3b41460e10753dd93637bfa4ad2/header.jpg?t=1747212894","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257071303,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257071303/movie480.mp4?t=1747130041","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257071303/movie_max.mp4?t=1747130041"},"name":"Super Stream-Bara","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257071303/4fee6066cbcc9ad8aaaa5bd8cfa0d392e087e48f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747130041","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257071303/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747130041","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257071303/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747130041"}}],"name":"Super Stream-Bara","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4 GhZ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb